# The note unit: the Rust build, the console bundle and its vendor copy, the dev host's build, and
# the code graph areas. The fork ignores root markdown, which would hide the unit's own rulebook.
!/CLAUDE.md
!/PERSONAL-DATA.md
/target
/settings.local.toml
/client/blocksuite
/client/dist
/client/.output
/client/.nuxt
/client/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
/client/console/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
/client/dev-app/.output
/client/dev-app/.nuxt
/client/dev-app/dist
/client/dev-app/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.graph/*
!.graph/settings.toml
